
## ./lib/pm/.., ##

 this directory keeps local copies of various perl modules that are
 not up to date or problematic when installed using debian packages
 or directly from CPAN [ i.e. X11::Protocol::Ext::RANDR ]

 some modules might be modified to work arround issues \ bugs

 protocol-7 zenki will prefer them to regular @INC ones

